@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@activityId = 1

### List activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities

### Read one (replace activityId with the ID returned by POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/{{activityId}}

### Create an activity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Campus coding club","details":"Bring a laptop to Room B."}

### Invalid input: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"   ","details":"Bring a laptop to Room B."}

### Valid ID, absent on a fresh exercise database: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/2147483647

### Invalid ID: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/abc
